name josefin
category Package
revision 57152
shortdesc Josefin fonts with LaTeX support
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Josefin Sans family of fonts, designed by
longdesc Santiago Orozco of the Typemade foundry in Monterey, Mexico.
longdesc Josefin Sans is available in seven weights, with corresponding
longdesc italics.
